## Apotek Lestari keystore configuration
##
## Copy this file to `signing.properties` (gitignored) and fill in
## with your own keystore. The release build picks it up
## automatically; without it (or with an incomplete signing setup)
## the verifyReleaseSigning guard FAILS the release build, so a
## release APK can never silently ship signed with the debug key.
## Debug builds are unaffected and always work without a keystore.
## KEYSTORE_PATH is relative to kotlin-app/ (or absolute).

KEYSTORE_PATH=apotek.jks
KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=
KEY_ALIAS=
KEY_PASSWORD=
